        <mxCell id="callout" value="&lt;b&gt;Two algorithms, not one.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; YOLO11 answers &lt;i&gt;what and where&lt;/i&gt; on each frame; BoT-SORT answers &lt;i&gt;which box is the same object as last frame&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Without the tracker, one tomato would be logged once per frame instead of once per item — &lt;b&gt;track_id&lt;/b&gt; is what makes the item log count items." style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff4e0;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
